	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nU3: Runs the tracker firmware (QuecOpen / QuecPython). Land pattern is a reconstruction - VERIFY\nC16: power-on pulse: tau = C16 x R9 = 2.2 s, PWRKEY low >= 500 ms\nR10: fit for permanent auto power-on (no PWRKEY shutdown)\nU8: Pin-out per ETSI TS 102 671 MFF2 (1 GND 2 VPP 3 I/O 6 CLK 7 RST 8 VCC) - VERIFY with the SIM vendor\nC19: L-match with R14: shunt C or L on the bench"
